    "overview": "B iterated on the author's feedback (2026-10-13): the salmon underline is retired. Section heads stay calls in the wordmark serif (latest(), posts( … )), and the parentheses of every call — wordmark included — carry link blue, the site's one accent. The archive call runs: posts( … ) is a live filter over all 38 posts, with a year strip whose bar heights are the posts per year. The page closes on the wordmark as a sign-off.",
